Given the nature of the BSCs, we determine $\mathcal{P}^1$ by searching for the optimal selection of $V$ bits to be assigned to the first $V$ locations in $\mathcal{P}^1$ and then order the remaining $N-V$ in the remaining locations in $\mathcal{P}^1$.
