\section{Conclusion}
In this paper, we investigated how to improve the performance of polar decoding in wireless communication systems where channels have different levels of reliability. We showed that not all coded bits are equally important for decoding, and mapping the most important bits to the more reliable channels can help in terms of decoding polar codes and attain lower bit error rates.
