\section{Formal Results for \FlexiSLH}
\label{sec:formal-results}

The main goal of this section is to prove that \FlexiSLH enforces
relative security (\autoref{def:rs-sec}), and from there to derive
security of other \SLH variants that are special cases of \FlexiSLH.

