\subsection{Generation Evaluation in the Face of Language Diversity}
\label{language_families}
Despite their shortcomings, the effectiveness of n-gram-based as well as neural based metrics for evaluation of generation has not been systematically studied across language families with varying word complexity and boundary characteristics. 
%the foundation of n-gram metrics.
This raises concerns, as the linguistic properties of words may well affect the usability of n-gram metrics,  
