    while DeltaNet ($n_h{=}1$) is limited to $S_2$ (parity). 
    (\textit{Right}) Length extrapolation of DeltaProduct improves significantly with higher $n_h$.}\vspace{3mm}
  \label{fig:motivation}
\end{minipage}
