If there is a LOS path between the RIS and UE $k$, then one of the deterministic components $\myexp^{\imagj \theta_{k,s}} \hat{\bh}_{k,s}$ corresponds to this path. In turn, $\theta_{k,s} \sim \mathcal{U}[0,2\pi)$ is the independent random phase shift induced by the UE mobility and affecting the $s$th deterministic component. 
