\subsection{BS-to-UE Cascade Channel}

The cascaded uplink (UL) channel from UE $k$ to the BS, through the RIS, is the $\Na$-dimensional vector $\bar{\bh}_k = \bH \bP \bh_k$.
By letting $\bp \!=\! \diag(\bP)\!=\![p_1,\ldots,p_{\Nr}]\trans$, $\bH_k \!=\!\diag(\bh_k) \!\in\!\mC^{\Nr\times\Nr}$, and  $\bG_k \!\triangleq\! \bH \bH_k \!\in\! \mC^{\Na \times \Nr}$, note that we also have 
\begin{equation}
\bar{\bh}_k  = \bH \bH_k \bp = \bG_k \bp\,.
\end{equation}

