 It should be noted that  our study  focuses exclusively on the stability of phase retrieval in finite-dimensional spaces \(\mathbb{H}^d\). More general settings, including phase retrieval in infinite-dimensional Banach spaces and their stability properties, are discussed in \cite{alaifari2017phase, cahill2016phase, grohs2020phase}. Unlike the finite-dimensional case, it has been shown that phase retrieval in infinite dimensions is inherently unstable. Additionally, the stability of finite-dimensional phase retrieval under perturbations of the frame vectors has been studied in \cite{alharbi2023stable}.
