\subsection{Integrating Scheduling Languages with Autotuning}
\label{subsec:explore-while-autotune}

%Scheduling languages facilitate a systematic exploration across alternative specifications to locate an optimized schedule, generating code variants from a compact specification of optimizations.  As the best optimization strategy is dependent on both the architecture and the input data set, s
Systems that use scheduling languages employ different techniques for deriving 
