To measure the signal-to-noise ratio, we employ Tuned-Lens~\citep{belrose2023eliciting}. Specifically, we train linear projections to learn the appropriate transformation over intermediate representations across layers. The lens for finetuned BABILong models have been trained on the validation set of The Pile with a similar configuration to the original tuned lens paper. Evaluation has been done on the test set created in the retrieval task, which stands for 2k examples. For each example, the needle probability is gathered from each layer.


