Neural network implementations,  the derivations and the detailed inference model are in Appendix~\ref{app: Neural Network Implementation of AMORE-MIO}, ~\ref{app: Derivation of Optimization Objective of AMORE-MIO}. and~\ref{app: Inference Model of AMORE-MIO}.
