\subsection{Multi-object Hybrid Dynamical Systems}
% while equation discovery in hybrid systems has been researched in single-object scenarios, the more general systems with multiple objects potentially interacting with each other is an unexplored but more general setting. 
Equation discovery in multi-object hybrid dynamical systems is an unexplored but more general setting.
