	\item \textbf{Historical development of the CE method:} A journey through the evolution and milestones of the CE method, setting the stage for its current applications.
	\item \textbf{Theoretical foundation of the CE method:} An exploration of the probabilistic principles and mechanisms that constitute the backbone of the CE method.
	\item \textbf{MATLAB Implementation: The \pkg{CEopt} package:} A walkthrough into the code  architecture, highlighting its modular design, user-friendliness, and integration capabilities.
