\section{Numerical Results} \label{sec:Numerical Results}
The proposed methods are applied to maneuver detection in cislunar space, where the dynamics exhibit strong nonlinearity, resulting in non-Gaussian distributed uncertainties. All simulations are conducted on a personal laptop equipped with a 2.5 GHz processor (12th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-12500H) and 16 GB of RAM, using Python 3.10 within the PyCharm development environment.

