\section{Experiments}\label{sec:experiments}
\vspace{-0.01\textheight}
    We now present quantitative and qualitative results demonstrating the effectiveness of our proposed Audio-SDS framework on three audio tasks: (1) FM synthesis, (2) impact synthesis, and (3) source separation. 
