Query computed is \allowbreak
        $_{u}\agg_{\textbf{Count}(v)}(\allowbreak
            \sigma_{u.\textit{language} = \textrm{`EN'} \land
            u.\textit{created\char`_at} \textrm{ is between 1/1 and 1/4}}(\allowbreak
