\section{Conclusion}\label{sec:Conclusion}
In this paper, we introduced a novel construction and a low-complexity encoder for FDPC codes. At short block lengths, simulation results demonstrate both improved error-correction performance and reduced latency compared to the message passing decoding of polar and 5G LDPC codes. For moderate block lengths, we also compared the performance of our proposed FDPC codes with that of 5G LDPC and 5G polar codes, highlighting the advantages of the proposed design.



