From this, we observe a clear trend indicating jobs with higher GPU memory utilization tend to consume more instantaneous power. Prior studies on GPU power consumption have shown that memory-intensive kernels consume 20--30\% more energy than compute-intensive kernels \cite{7830508}, aligning with our findings.

\begin{mybox}
