\section{Conclusions}
\vspace{-1.5mm}
%As HPC systems continue to scale to meet growing demands, they are becoming increasingly heterogeneous. 
%These systems generate massive volumes of log data, presenting challenges in data integration and analysis. %and while making use of this data poses challenges, 
