\section{Ethical Considerations and Limitations}\label{ethical-considerations-and-limitations}

The integration of Deep Research systems into knowledge workflows introduces significant ethical considerations and technical limitations that must be addressed for responsible deployment. This section examines key challenges across four fundamental dimensions (see Figure~\ref{fig:ethics}): information integrity, privacy protection, source attribution and intellectual property, and accessibility.

