 & \textbf{\textit{10M rows (6 GB)}}& \textbf{\textit{50M rows (30 GB)}} \\
\hline
Parquet file in S3& 1.26 (0.14) & 6.14 (0.98) \\
Parquet file on SSD& 0.92 (0.09) & 4.37 (0.15) \\
