Since the first-order derivative of $y^\star_j$ is positive, $y^\star_j$ is a monotonic function.

\subsubsection{Scalability}
We set a parameter denoted as $\beta$. The constraint of it is $\beta \in (1,+\infty)$. $\mathcal{F}_{sca} = \beta\mathcal{G}(\boldsymbol{Y})-\mathcal{G}(\beta\boldsymbol{Y})$ is formulated as

